    "description": "<p class='mt-3'>Hi! I'm Ahmed, a bug creator and fixer. I'm into OSS and care about online privacy.</p><p class='mt-3'>I'm in the business since the <a class='underline font-semibold' href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Floppy_disk'>floppy disks</a> existed. Back in the days, I liked to refer to myself as a programmer but now with all the names around I'm little confused.</p><p class='mt-3'>I mainly study, teach young adults, review and write instructions to computers. I also like to help small businesses get a presence in the Web. I decided to start to post <a class='underline font-semibold' href='http://ahmedev.com/portfolio'>my projects here</a>.</p><p class='mt-3'>I continue pivoting like the field does and <a class='underline font-semibold' href='http://ahmedev.com/now'>my current focus</a> is understanding AI systems.</p><p class='mt-3'>This is a 100% human content and you can read my current <a class='underline font-semibold' href='http://ahmedev.com/ai'>AI manifesto</a>.</p>",
